    <briefdescription>
<para>Format provider for <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1sys_1a52f2c3fdd7f80c1991d8c7079489efff" kindref="member">TimePoint&lt;&gt;</ref> </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The options string is a strftime format string, with extensions:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>L is millis: 000-999</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>f is micros: 000000-999999</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>N is nanos: 000000000 - 999999999</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>If no options are given, the default format is &quot;%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%N&quot;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
